  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Bug Fixes\n      - Fixed an error that occurred in scripts when the initialization and condition parts of a for loop were omitted.\n      - Adjusted overload resolution in scripts.\n      - Fixed an issue where scripts would error if a value‑type module variable was not initialized.\n      - Fixed an issue that prevented editing values in General Field IDs.\n      - Fixed an issue where color settings remained after moving from a colored Module to a ProCodeModule.\n\n      # New Features\n      - Added an option to hide text in the sidebar and header.\n      - Added support for specifying image files from resources in the sidebar.\n      - When using a hierarchical sidebar, you can now specify an icon for the root node as well.\n      - Added a year‑and‑month‑only mode to DateField.\n      - Added an option on list pages to disable the use of URL parameters.\n      - ModuleSearcher can now combine conditions with OR logic.\n      - In scripts, arithmetic and other operators can now be used on non‑numeric types, so long as those operators are implemented for the type.",
